DIALOGS = [
[anyone, "gm_KNIGHTS", [
   ],"The Basilisk Knights are a completely separate branch within the Serpent Host, and with a good reason. Their tale is dark and shrouded in mystery. All I know is that they follow a sort of grotesque warrior cult on their own, hypnotizing themselves before battle to bring their skills to inhuman levels. If it wasn't for their unquestioned distrust towards Sanjar's family, I wouldn't have even accepted their services at all. Their abilities are unmatched with bow and blade, but their grim ways give a reason to fear even for me. It is hard for outsiders like you to earn their respect, though once you do, you may have a fearsome force at your hands.", "gm_pretalk", []],
]
